cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use CipherDock, please cite it as below."
title: "CipherDock: A Jailbreak-Free Hybrid Static-Dynamic iOS Application Analysis Framework"
authors:
  - family-names: Ameen Noman
    given-names: Sinan
  - family-names: Ameen Noman
    given-names: Haitham
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-05-26
url: "https://github.com/alanisinan/CipherDock"
license: MIT
abstract: "A jailbreak-free hybrid static-dynamic iOS IPA analysis 
  framework with deterministic risk scoring across seven evidence-weighted 
  categories, Frida companion-build dynamic capture, and cross-layer 
  endpoint correlation. Evaluated on a 35-IPA corpus achieving 
  F1=0.9474 (95% CI [0.8235, 1.0000])."
keywords:
  - iOS security
  - IPA analysis
  - static analysis
  - dynamic analysis
  - Frida
  - jailbreak-free
  - mobile security
  - reverse engineering
